{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43277","headline":"四水合流 · 李沛","name":"四水合流","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禹凿山川地，因通四水流。\n萦回过凤阙，会合出皇州。\n天影长波里，寒声古度头。\n入河无昼夜，归海有谦柔。\n顺物宜投石，逢时可载舟。\n羡鱼犹未已，临水欲垂钩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李沛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}